- Phase 1 asset/schema tasks -> proposal Asset settings -> collectible attributes, explicit independent defaults, default pivot, engine matrix order, and reference size, optional wedge angle -> current `ModelTransform`/`JsonObject`/collectible source, installed pickaxe transforms and attribute patches; contract recorded in the proposal.
