- Phase 1 coverage/ownership tasks -> proposal Coverage and fallback / Scope and ownership -> patch current families, keep unrelated entries unchanged, directional ownership -> current discovery/layout/icon/capture source and 23-file installed asset inventory above. Source inspection is not visual acceptance.

