- Wedge context and unchanged clipping -> proposal Scope and ownership / Rendering behavior -> [IRadialMenuContextIcon](../../VanillaExpanded/src/RadialMenu/IRadialMenuContextIcon.cs), [RadialMenuRenderer](../../VanillaExpanded/src/RadialMenu/RadialMenuRenderer.cs), and [RadialMenuIconHalo](../../VanillaExpanded/src/RadialMenu/RadialMenuIconHalo.cs) convey actual clockwise wedge direction with existing effective position/size and keep capture, halo, stencil, and unrelated artwork paths.
