- Historical single preparation, nesting, and fallback -> superseded hook contract -> `VanillaExpanded/src/ItemRendering/ToolHeadPresentationScope.cs` and `ToolHeadPresentationHook.cs` formerly bound a slot and replaced the engine local matrix. These files and their hook-specific tests are now removed.
- Historical live renderer support and lifecycle -> superseded hook contract -> [ToolHeadRendererEligibility](../../VanillaExpanded/src/ItemRendering/ToolHeadRendererEligibility.cs) contains reusable registry/projection checks. [ToolHeadPresentationRenderer](../../VanillaExpanded/src/ItemRendering/ToolHeadPresentationRenderer.cs) and [ToolHeadPresentationSystem](../../VanillaExpanded/src/ItemRendering/ToolHeadPresentationSystem.cs) now perform direct drawing and client lifetime ownership without patch installation or availability state.

